00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:37.140
BUT Felix we want to hear how you broke your Ass.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.880
Well, I'm getting there. Okay?

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.760
Papa needs some watch time.

